/* >>> CARD-HOVER START: cards lift with a deeper shadow and a gold edge when the mouse is over them (Health service boxes, Travel service rows, the numbered step cards and treatment/department cards); photos zoom in slightly. Mouse only, not on touch screens. 2026-10-17 (Anna) */
.medlux-hub-box, .medlux-rows .medlux-row, .medlux-steps .medlux-card, .medlux-treatment-grid .medlux-card, .medlux-dept-grid .medlux-card { transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease; }
