/* >>> LANG-MOBILE START: header layout on all screens (name kept for history). Phone: logo/title close to the left edge, search + language flag + menu evenly spaced on the right, title shrinks/hides on very narrow screens, search/flag hidden while the hamburger menu is open, menu title in the same thin letters as the header. Tablet: logo left, search - Free Consultation - flag - menu right-aligned with equal gaps (600-781px had lost them); language panel opens to the left. Laptop/desktop: search close to Free Consultation, a narrower language panel opens to the right and ends 12px from the screen edge. An opened search field covers the flag. 2026-10-17 (Anna) */
